#: src/capture.rs:626
msgid ""
"SuperShot is running inside a __CHANNEL__ sandbox, so it cannot "
"use                  command-line screenshot tools installed on the host. "
"Install an XDG desktop                  portal backend for your desktop "
"environment (xdg-desktop-portal-gnome,                  xdg-desktop-portal-"
"kde, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr or xdg-desktop-portal-gtk)                  and "
"restart your session."
msgstr ""

#: src/capture.rs:643
msgid "Every available screenshot tool failed to produce an image."
msgstr ""
"利用可能なスクリーンショットツールはいずれも画像を生成できませんでした。"

